===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|quethen|lang=enm}}, {{term|cwethen|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{term|cweþan|lang=ang}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|en}} {{m|gem-pro|*kweþaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|en}} {{m|ine-pro|*gʷét-||to say, speak}}. Cognate with {{etyl|stq|-}} {{m|stq|kweede||to say, speak, tell}}, {{etyl|da|-}} {{term|kvæde|lang=da}}, {{etyl|is|-}} {{m|is|kveða||to say}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/kwiːð/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-quethe.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|quethes|quething|quethed|past2=quoth|past3=quod|quethed|past_ptc2=quethen}}

# {{context|obsolete|_|except in past tense [[quoth]]|lang=en}} To [[say]] or [[declare]].
#* '''1845''', [[w:Edgar Allan Poe|Edgar Allan Poe]], "[[s:The Raven (Poe)|The Raven]]"
#*: '''Quoth''' the raven, "Nevermore."

